  "description": "Pandoc-style citation + bibliography plugin for NuStreamDocs. Reads a CSL-JSON source file, finds [@key] / [@key, p 23] / [@a; @b] markers in markdown, and emits formatted citations + a categorized bibliography list at the end of each page. Ships with IEEE (numbered) and APA (author-year) styles; internal model uses CSL vocabulary so a future CSL backend slots in. AOT-clean.",
